  <notes>
    COMPLETED 2026-07-16 (§6.5 Path-A deviation — pre-investigated, not re-litigated): The POML's core
    mechanism premise ("reuse AppOnlyAnalysisService.AnalyzeEmailAsync" / IPlaybookOrchestrationService) is
    WRONG for rung 5. AnalyzeEmailAsync is a heavy DOCUMENT pipeline: it requires the .eml Document to already
    exist in Dataverse (GetDocumentByEmailLookupAsync), is keyed by email-activity id (NOT the envelope), runs
    a fixed summarization playbook, and produces NO structured classification. Rung 5 runs during association
    resolution over the NormalizedMessage envelope BEFORE that Document exists. Correct primitive =
    IOpenAiClient.GetStructuredCompletionAsync&lt;T&gt; (the guaranteed-valid-JSON structured-output call the
    Finance classification path uses via IInvoiceAi). Implemented as: NEW ICommunicationClassificationAi facade
    (+ CommunicationClassificationAi impl + NullCommunicationClassificationAi) wrapping IOpenAiClient (ADR-013
    seam); NEW CommunicationClassificationResult model; NEW AiClassificationRung (Kind 5, mirrors
    SemanticMatchRung) emitting METADATA-ONLY signals (no target ⇒ never auto-files, never forces a regarding
    write; category/obligations/rationale flow to provenance.signals); privilege flag-only (ADR-015); candidate
    record TYPES only via $choices enum (org→sprk_organization). NEW AiClassificationOptions
    (Communication:AiClassification kill-switch). The code-defined system prompt is the self-contained
    equivalent of the POML-requested Dataverse-resident JPS Action (works with no seeding, unit-testable); it
    MAY later migrate to a Dataverse playbook Description per ADR-014 (follow-up). ZERO engine/mapper change —
    IncomingAssociationResolver already partitions Kind 5 as AI (runs only on deterministic-miss) and
    AssociationStatusMapper already records metadata-only matches into provenance.signals. Build clean; 327
    Communication tests green (rung-5 unit tests deferred to 032); publish 45.30 MB compressed (~0 delta, ≤60
    ceiling); CVE = pre-existing transitive Kiota High only (0 new); Step 9.5 gates 0 Critical / 0 ADR violations.

    Per-rung telemetry + rung-5 unit tests land in task 032 — expose hooks here. This Action's structured output is reused by W5 task 053 ("Communication Triage" → `DeliverComposite`) — design the output schema so it serves both association-suggestion (here) and triage-summary (053) without a second LLM call where avoidable. `Services/Ai` internals are sole-owned by r2-core: consume PublicContracts, coordinate via `/conflict-check`, escalate a missing seam rather than forking.
  </notes>

